@block capabilities:
The compiled output above starts with the MERGED frontmatter: base keys
plus child keys, child winning on collisions. `audience` comes only from
the base template; `role` is overridden here; `focus` and `style` exist
only in this child. Arrays replace wholesale; nested maps merge per key.
Focus areas:
@for item in focus:
- {{item}}
@end
@end
